\ ==== path keys ====

{ /addr/city 1 } /addr/city @ . cr
{ /addr/city 1 /addr/zip 2 } /addr/zip @ . cr
{ /a/b/c 42 } :a @ :b @ frame>json . cr
[ /p/q 7 :z 9 ] array>frame /p/q @ . cr
[ /p/q 7 :z 9 ] array>frame :z @ . cr
\ error: empty path key in a literal
{ [ ] 5 } . cr
\ error: non-symbol element in a path key
{ [ 1 2 ] 5 } . cr
\ error: key that is neither symbol nor path
{ 42 5 } . cr
\ error: empty path key via array>frame (op name threads through)
[ [ ] 5 ] array>frame . cr
\ error: non-symbol path element via array>frame
[ [ 1 2 ] 5 ] array>frame . cr

clear

\ ==== select values ====

{ :a { :x 1 :y 2 } } /a/* select-values . cr
{ :a { :x 1 } :b { :x 2 } } /*/x select-values . cr
{ :a 1 } /a select-values . cr
{ :a 1 } /z select-values . cr
{ :a { :b { :city 1 } } :x { :city 2 } } //city select-values . cr
{ :a { :city 1 } } /a//city select-values . cr
{ :a { :x 1 } :b { :x 2 :y 3 } } //* select-values . cr
{ } dup :self swap ! //x select-values . cr

\ malformed predicate steps must error, not read past a short array (M2):
\ an empty-array step has no op/key; a comparison op with no value misses items[2].
{ :a 1 } [ :a [ ] ] select-values . cr
{ :a 1 } [ [ 1 :a ] ] select-values . cr

clear
